1
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:42,320
<font color="#ffffff">You lost your memory.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

2
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:44,640
<font color="#ffffff">How can you be so sure</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

3
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:46,440
<font color="#ffffff">who you used to be?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

4
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:49,280
<font color="#ffffff">Don't you trust your own instincts?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

5
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,520
<font color="#ffffff">But trusting your instincts</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

6
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:56,280
<font color="#ffffff">doesn't mean Deputy Papon isn't guilty.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

7
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:58,720
<font color="#ffffff">PREVIOUSLY</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

8
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,600
<font color="#ffffff">I'm counting on you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

9
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:02,120
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

10
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:07,280
<font color="#ffffff">I don't think we can trust</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Chansuek anymore, Ya.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

11
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:11,280
<font color="#ffffff">-Da!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

12
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:13,080
<font color="#ffffff">-Help me.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Right.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

13
00:03:16,440 --> 00:03:17,680
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, Sergeant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

14
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:21,600
<font color="#ffffff">What is this document?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

15
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,960
<font color="#ffffff">It's an old case file, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

16
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:25,280
<font color="#ffffff">An old case?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

17
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,560
<font color="#ffffff">Where are you taking it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

18
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:29,480
<font color="#ffffff">ROBBERY CASE OF SGT. PADEJ SAKSUEA</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">BY POL. CAPT. CHANSUEK SAMANYA<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

19
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:31,920
<font color="#ffffff">By the way, Captain…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

20
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:34,680
<font color="#ffffff">Why are you reviewing</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Padej's case?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

21
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:11,720
<font color="#ffffff">ROBBERY CASE OF SGT. PADEJ SAKSUEA</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">BY POL. CAPT. CHANSUEK SAMANYA<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

22
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:15,120
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Something is not right,</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>just like Ya suspected.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

23
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,560
<font color="#ffffff">Kan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

24
00:04:18,640 --> 00:04:21,240
<font color="#ffffff">Do you really believe Padej</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">stole that diamond?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

25
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,680
<font color="#ffffff">You don't believe it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

26
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:32,240
<font color="#ffffff">You know Sergeant Padej is a good man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

27
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:35,200
<font color="#ffffff">I think he was definitely set up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

28
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:38,640
<font color="#ffffff">It's not my division's case.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know the details.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

29
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:43,480
<font color="#ffffff">The detectives say</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the evidence against him<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

30
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:46,080
<font color="#ffffff">is pretty solid.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

31
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:48,400
<font color="#ffffff">But I don't believe he'd do such a thing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

32
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,720
<font color="#ffffff">He saved my life.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

33
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:53,760
<font color="#ffffff">I owe him, Kan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

34
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:55,560
<font color="#ffffff">I know he saved you before,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

35
00:04:55,640 --> 00:04:57,440
<font color="#ffffff">but no matter how much you owe him,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

36
00:04:57,520 --> 00:05:00,560
<font color="#ffffff">I can't just clear him of the charges.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

37
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:03,680
<font color="#ffffff">I told you he was framed!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

38
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:04,760
<font color="#ffffff">He didn't do it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

39
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:06,280
<font color="#ffffff">Besides,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

40
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:09,760
<font color="#ffffff">a man who risks his life to save others</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">without fear of death<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

41
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:12,440
<font color="#ffffff">wouldn't do that for money.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

42
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:14,400
<font color="#ffffff">You're still too naive.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

43
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:17,240
<font color="#ffffff">Some people help just for future gain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

44
00:05:17,320 --> 00:05:19,720
<font color="#ffffff">Just tell me if you'll help me or not.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

45
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:22,440
<font color="#ffffff">I have no choice.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

46
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:27,280
<font color="#ffffff">If the evidence points to his guilt,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I have to do my duty.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

47
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,840
<font color="#ffffff">You do have a choice,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

48
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:31,640
<font color="#ffffff">but you choose not to help me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

49
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:34,040
<font color="#ffffff">You choose your duty over what is right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

50
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:37,200
<font color="#ffffff">My duty is to protect justice,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

51
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:38,840
<font color="#ffffff">not to do what people want.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

52
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:47,320
<font color="#ffffff">So why would you help him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

53
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:49,640
<font color="#ffffff">I want to find out the truth.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

54
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:53,600
<font color="#ffffff">That's why your opinion matters in this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

55
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:55,680
<font color="#ffffff">I need your help.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

56
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:01,600
<font color="#ffffff">My opinion is unchanged, Ya.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

57
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,240
<font color="#ffffff">Evidence will decide.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

58
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:26,560
<font color="#ffffff">Ya.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

59
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:29,520
<font color="#ffffff">Please take me to Luang Pho Suea.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

60
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:53,280
<font color="#ffffff">Junior should be here by now, right?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

61
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,280
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

62
00:06:55,800 --> 00:07:00,240
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, right! He was looking for something</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in your place the other day.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

63
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:03,080
<font color="#ffffff">I asked him.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">He said he was cleaning up the place.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

64
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,520
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't believe him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

65
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,320
<font color="#ffffff">What was Boonrod looking for?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

66
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:15,040
<font color="#ffffff">Senior disciple,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

67
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:16,440
<font color="#ffffff">can I ask a question?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

68
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:18,560
<font color="#ffffff">Sure. Just ask away!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

69
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:22,600
<font color="#ffffff">Okay, so you've been with Luang Pho</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">all the time, right?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

70
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:25,760
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, my whole life.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

71
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:27,640
<font color="#ffffff">I see.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

72
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:29,800
<font color="#ffffff">Then have you ever seen something</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

73
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:33,080
<font color="#ffffff">like a small, shiny, beautiful pink rock</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">that he keeps?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

74
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:34,040
<font color="#ffffff">Have you seen it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

75
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:36,960
<font color="#ffffff">A shiny, beautiful pink rock?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

76
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:39,880
<font color="#ffffff">It's something incredibly valuable</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">that everyone wants. You know?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

77
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:44,480
<font color="#ffffff">He was asking about</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">something shiny and valuable.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

78
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:46,880
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know what he was talking about.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

79
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:49,480
<font color="#ffffff">Shiny and valuable?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

80
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:54,760
<font color="#ffffff">Could it be…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

81
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:56,960
<font color="#ffffff">What? You know it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

82
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:02,000
<font color="#ffffff">Could it be that…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

83
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:04,880
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod has regained his memory?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

84
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:27,200
<font color="#ffffff">If the diamond is really</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">with Luang Pho Suea,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

85
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:31,360
<font color="#ffffff">I may need to set up a situation</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to force it out of him.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

86
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:54,800
<font color="#ffffff">There! Junior is here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

87
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,400
<font color="#ffffff">Hey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

88
00:08:58,480 --> 00:09:01,880
<font color="#ffffff">Good, Boonrod. I'm glad you got home safe.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

89
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:04,680
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho, why are you waiting for me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

90
00:09:09,160 --> 00:09:11,560
<font color="#ffffff">Well, it's nothing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

91
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:15,360
<font color="#ffffff">You're tired. You should get some rest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

92
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,520
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

93
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:20,120
<font color="#ffffff">I need to talk to you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

94
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,560
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Wait, Luang Pho.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

95
00:10:31,640 --> 00:10:33,880
<font color="#ffffff">I want to warn you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

96
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:35,640
<font color="#ffffff">about Captain Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

97
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:39,480
<font color="#ffffff">About Boonrod?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

98
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:41,080
<font color="#ffffff">Why?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

99
00:10:41,680 --> 00:10:43,520
<font color="#ffffff">You should stay away from him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

100
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:47,000
<font color="#ffffff">He'll only bring you trouble, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

101
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:53,720
<font color="#ffffff">That's all I can tell you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

102
00:11:04,640 --> 00:11:05,480
<font color="#ffffff">Tofu.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

103
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:09,200
<font color="#ffffff">Go and play somewhere else.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

104
00:11:09,280 --> 00:11:11,000
<font color="#ffffff">Adults need to talk.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

105
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:53,320
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

106
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:57,600
<font color="#ffffff">What do you want to talk about? Go ahead.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

107
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:10,880
<font color="#ffffff">I want to talk about the diamond.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

108
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:20,200
<font color="#ffffff">So you've regained your memory?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

109
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:25,120
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

110
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:29,360
<font color="#ffffff">I remember where I took the diamond.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

111
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:36,200
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I'm sorry for lying, Luang Pho.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

112
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:49,480
<font color="#ffffff">Where did you take it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

113
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:00,160
<font color="#ffffff">I took it to…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

114
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:05,480
<font color="#ffffff">I took it to…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

115
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:14,560
<font color="#ffffff">Ouch!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

116
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:15,520
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

117
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:21,000
<font color="#ffffff">My head hurts!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

118
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:24,120
<font color="#ffffff">-Ouch!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey, Boonrod? Boonrod!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

119
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:25,720
<font color="#ffffff">-Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What's wrong?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

120
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:29,640
<font color="#ffffff">My head hurts!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

121
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:31,120
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong with you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

122
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:32,680
<font color="#ffffff">Are you okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

123
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:34,560
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

124
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:42,240
<font color="#ffffff">Who told you to act</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">without asking me first?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

125
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:45,840
<font color="#ffffff">We were ordered to find</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">whoever stole the diamond.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

126
00:13:45,920 --> 00:13:48,720
<font color="#ffffff">Now we know who the suspect is.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

127
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,600
<font color="#ffffff">Who?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

128
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:52,720
<font color="#ffffff">Kamnan Sawaeng.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

129
00:13:53,560 --> 00:13:55,960
<font color="#ffffff">The influential mob boss in Mae Hong Son.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

130
00:13:56,560 --> 00:13:57,680
<font color="#ffffff">How sure are you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

131
00:13:58,520 --> 00:14:00,760
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not totally sure,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

132
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:02,400
<font color="#ffffff">so I need to investigate him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

133
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:06,520
<font color="#ffffff">This is Darat, the owner of the resort</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in Mae Hong Son.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

134
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:10,640
<font color="#ffffff">She will be helping you infiltrate</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Kamnan Sawaeng's operations.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

135
00:14:31,640 --> 00:14:33,680
<font color="#ffffff">Hey! Back off!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

136
00:14:44,760 --> 00:14:46,760
<font color="#ffffff">How did those cops know</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

137
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:48,760
<font color="#ffffff">Kamnan Sawaeng's diamonds</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">were in this house?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

138
00:14:49,680 --> 00:14:50,840
<font color="#ffffff">That's what I'm saying.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

139
00:14:50,920 --> 00:14:54,400
<font color="#ffffff">There must be a mole among us.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

140
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:57,400
<font color="#ffffff">I know who it is.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

141
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:59,120
<font color="#ffffff">Who do you mean?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

142
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:02,240
<font color="#ffffff">The guy who just started working</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for Kamnan Sawaeng.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

143
00:16:17,080 --> 00:16:19,920
<font color="#ffffff">Hand over the diamonds, Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

144
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,400
<font color="#ffffff">Otherwise, I'll kill you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

145
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:22,720
<font color="#ffffff">Move it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

146
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:31,640
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

147
00:16:36,800 --> 00:16:38,160
<font color="#ffffff">Are you okay, Boonrod?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

148
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:48,560
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong? Are you okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

149
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:50,120
<font color="#ffffff">I'm…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

150
00:16:51,040 --> 00:16:52,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'm okay now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

151
00:17:05,359 --> 00:17:06,319
<font color="#ffffff">A monk?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

152
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:08,079
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

153
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:10,920
<font color="#ffffff">How did you get here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

154
00:17:11,520 --> 00:17:12,520
<font color="#ffffff">How are you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

155
00:17:12,599 --> 00:17:16,119
<font color="#ffffff">Please… help me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

156
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:26,839
<font color="#ffffff">Some bad guys</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">are looking for this diamond.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

157
00:17:28,520 --> 00:17:32,720
<font color="#ffffff">I need you to keep it for me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

158
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:37,080
<font color="#ffffff">I remember…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

159
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:39,960
<font color="#ffffff">where I left the diamond.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

160
00:17:49,760 --> 00:17:51,680
<font color="#ffffff">I left it with you, didn't I?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

161
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:06,960
<font color="#ffffff">Who is this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

162
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:18,360
<font color="#ffffff">Hey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

163
00:18:20,040 --> 00:18:21,320
<font color="#ffffff">This is…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

164
00:18:24,320 --> 00:18:26,960
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

165
00:18:27,040 --> 00:18:29,280
<font color="#ffffff">Chansuek. Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

166
00:18:37,800 --> 00:18:38,760
<font color="#ffffff">A monk?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

167
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:40,520
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

168
00:18:41,120 --> 00:18:43,360
<font color="#ffffff">How did you get here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

169
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:44,960
<font color="#ffffff">How are you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

170
00:18:45,560 --> 00:18:48,560
<font color="#ffffff">Please… help me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

171
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:59,280
<font color="#ffffff">Some bad guys</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">are looking for this diamond.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

172
00:19:00,800 --> 00:19:05,160
<font color="#ffffff">I need you to keep it for me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

173
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:12,480
<font color="#ffffff">Hey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

174
00:19:12,560 --> 00:19:14,400
<font color="#ffffff">Chansuek! Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

175
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:30,000
<font color="#ffffff">What's going on?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

176
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:56,240
<font color="#ffffff">Why are we visiting Luang Pho Suea?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

177
00:19:56,320 --> 00:19:58,920
<font color="#ffffff">See the file in front of you? Take a look.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

178
00:20:02,120 --> 00:20:05,160
<font color="#ffffff">ROBBERY CASE OF SGT. PADEJ SAKSUEA</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">BY POL. CAPT. CHANSUEK SAMANYA<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

179
00:20:08,760 --> 00:20:09,840
<font color="#ffffff">This is…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

180
00:20:10,440 --> 00:20:11,520
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

181
00:20:12,160 --> 00:20:15,280
<font color="#ffffff">It's the case file on Sergeant Padej</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">from six years ago.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

182
00:20:18,880 --> 00:20:20,440
<font color="#ffffff">Why did you…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

183
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:25,400
<font color="#ffffff">Deputy Papon was in charge</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">of that investigation,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

184
00:20:25,480 --> 00:20:28,080
<font color="#ffffff">so I thought you might be onto something.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

185
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:30,400
<font color="#ffffff">And you were right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

186
00:20:30,960 --> 00:20:31,960
<font color="#ffffff">How?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

187
00:20:32,040 --> 00:20:33,440
<font color="#ffffff">The evidence was weak.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

188
00:20:53,840 --> 00:20:55,600
<font color="#ffffff">Does this mean</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

189
00:20:56,400 --> 00:20:59,320
<font color="#ffffff">you've regained your memory, Boonrod?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

190
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:05,320
<font color="#ffffff">Or rather,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

191
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:07,040
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

192
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:12,080
<font color="#ffffff">I said, do you have the diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

193
00:21:14,800 --> 00:21:15,880
<font color="#ffffff">I do.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

194
00:21:18,840 --> 00:21:20,440
<font color="#ffffff">I have the diamond.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

195
00:21:22,600 --> 00:21:25,440
<font color="#ffffff">All this time, why have you never told me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

196
00:21:29,800 --> 00:21:31,480
<font color="#ffffff">Calm down.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

197
00:21:32,640 --> 00:21:39,240
<font color="#ffffff">I kept it from you the whole time</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">because you lost your memory.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

198
00:21:40,560 --> 00:21:43,520
<font color="#ffffff">I had to take that diamond,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

199
00:21:44,200 --> 00:21:46,960
<font color="#ffffff">hide it somewhere safe,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

200
00:21:47,040 --> 00:21:50,960
<font color="#ffffff">and wait until you regained your memory.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

201
00:21:53,320 --> 00:21:54,680
<font color="#ffffff">So where is it now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

202
00:21:57,280 --> 00:21:59,320
<font color="#ffffff">I hid it in the forest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

203
00:22:02,120 --> 00:22:03,880
<font color="#ffffff">How can I trust you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

204
00:22:04,800 --> 00:22:05,920
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

205
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:07,640
<font color="#ffffff">Before this,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

206
00:22:07,720 --> 00:22:10,720
<font color="#ffffff">you searched my whole place, didn't you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

207
00:22:10,800 --> 00:22:12,480
<font color="#ffffff">Did you find it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

208
00:22:18,560 --> 00:22:20,000
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

209
00:22:21,280 --> 00:22:24,800
<font color="#ffffff">I'm going to get you a map</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

210
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:27,120
<font color="#ffffff">showing where the diamond is hidden.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

211
00:22:27,640 --> 00:22:29,120
<font color="#ffffff">Wait here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

212
00:22:30,120 --> 00:22:31,160
<font color="#ffffff">Just a moment.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

213
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:26,320
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

214
00:25:29,960 --> 00:25:30,880
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

215
00:26:09,680 --> 00:26:11,840
<font color="#ffffff">Pretty bold of you to come here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

216
00:26:30,120 --> 00:26:31,320
<font color="#ffffff">Excuse me, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

217
00:26:37,080 --> 00:26:38,120
<font color="#ffffff">What is it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

218
00:26:38,800 --> 00:26:40,360
<font color="#ffffff">Someone's here to see you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

219
00:26:42,640 --> 00:26:43,800
<font color="#ffffff">Who?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

220
00:26:48,360 --> 00:26:49,560
<font color="#ffffff">It's me, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

221
00:27:03,440 --> 00:27:06,000
<font color="#ffffff">I heard Captain Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">came to turn himself in.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

222
00:27:06,080 --> 00:27:06,960
<font color="#ffffff">He did.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

223
00:27:07,040 --> 00:27:08,040
<font color="#ffffff">What a bold move.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

224
00:27:08,120 --> 00:27:11,080
<font color="#ffffff">He must be confident</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">that Deputy Papon won't arrest him.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

225
00:27:11,160 --> 00:27:12,200
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

226
00:27:26,640 --> 00:27:28,400
<font color="#ffffff">Hello, Captain?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

227
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:31,600
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">just turned himself in, sir.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

228
00:27:33,440 --> 00:27:34,840
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

229
00:27:36,600 --> 00:27:37,440
<font color="#ffffff">Sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

230
00:27:38,400 --> 00:27:40,600
<font color="#ffffff">Thanks for telling me, Sergeant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

231
00:27:41,200 --> 00:27:42,400
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

232
00:27:54,960 --> 00:27:56,760
<font color="#ffffff">What did you say?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

233
00:27:56,840 --> 00:27:59,160
<font color="#ffffff">So Luang Pho Suea really has the diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

234
00:28:00,120 --> 00:28:01,240
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

235
00:28:01,960 --> 00:28:03,840
<font color="#ffffff">It is as you suspected.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

236
00:28:04,400 --> 00:28:06,160
<font color="#ffffff">After I got hurt,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

237
00:28:06,240 --> 00:28:08,080
<font color="#ffffff">I handed it to Luang Pho Suea</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">before I passed out.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

238
00:28:08,160 --> 00:28:09,720
<font color="#ffffff">Then he hid it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

239
00:28:11,400 --> 00:28:13,280
<font color="#ffffff">He kept it a secret</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

240
00:28:14,400 --> 00:28:16,040
<font color="#ffffff">until I remembered.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

241
00:28:16,120 --> 00:28:19,120
<font color="#ffffff">I confronted him about it,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and he admitted it.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

242
00:28:23,120 --> 00:28:26,200
<font color="#ffffff">I'm glad you've regained your memory.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

243
00:28:30,200 --> 00:28:31,680
<font color="#ffffff">Where is Luang Pho Suea now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

244
00:28:33,240 --> 00:28:34,280
<font color="#ffffff">He fled, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

245
00:28:37,440 --> 00:28:38,480
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

246
00:28:39,480 --> 00:28:40,640
<font color="#ffffff">How did he flee?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

247
00:28:46,120 --> 00:28:47,400
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

248
00:29:04,200 --> 00:29:05,760
<font color="#ffffff">Who was it, Kan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

249
00:29:06,480 --> 00:29:10,640
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Lerm said</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Chansuek just turned himself in.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

250
00:30:10,200 --> 00:30:12,320
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, guys.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

251
00:30:12,400 --> 00:30:15,840
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho, we need to leave this place.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

252
00:30:20,320 --> 00:30:21,680
<font color="#ffffff">What's going on?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

253
00:30:35,000 --> 00:30:39,440
<font color="#ffffff">What you're doing</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">will put you in danger, right?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

254
00:30:42,040 --> 00:30:43,120
<font color="#ffffff">It's fine, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

255
00:30:43,800 --> 00:30:45,240
<font color="#ffffff">I know what I'm doing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

256
00:30:47,000 --> 00:30:51,000
<font color="#ffffff">By now, Deputy Papon's team</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">is probably looking for you<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

257
00:30:51,080 --> 00:30:53,600
<font color="#ffffff">to get the map to the diamond</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">hidden in the forest.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

258
00:31:01,760 --> 00:31:03,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sorry</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

259
00:31:04,120 --> 00:31:06,320
<font color="#ffffff">for putting you in danger, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

260
00:31:08,720 --> 00:31:10,960
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not afraid of dying.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

261
00:31:11,040 --> 00:31:12,680
<font color="#ffffff">If giving up my life</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

262
00:31:12,760 --> 00:31:15,000
<font color="#ffffff">can make the world a better place,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

263
00:31:16,760 --> 00:31:18,560
<font color="#ffffff">then that's a good thing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

264
00:31:41,280 --> 00:31:42,920
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

265
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:45,800
<font color="#ffffff">I'll catch Luang Pho Suea</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and get the map to the diamond.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

266
00:31:46,960 --> 00:31:48,840
<font color="#ffffff">All right. Good.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

267
00:31:51,200 --> 00:31:52,640
<font color="#ffffff">It's just…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

268
00:31:53,560 --> 00:31:55,120
<font color="#ffffff">What is it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

269
00:31:56,880 --> 00:31:58,240
<font color="#ffffff">I'm a wanted man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

270
00:31:58,320 --> 00:32:00,440
<font color="#ffffff">It's not easy for me to make a move.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

271
00:32:08,200 --> 00:32:10,320
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry about that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

272
00:32:10,400 --> 00:32:11,240
<font color="#ffffff">Lieutenant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

273
00:32:12,000 --> 00:32:14,840
<font color="#ffffff">Write a withdrawal for his arrest warrant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

274
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:16,040
<font color="#ffffff">I'll sign it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

275
00:32:16,920 --> 00:32:18,000
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

276
00:32:20,840 --> 00:32:22,480
<font color="#ffffff">As of today,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

277
00:32:23,040 --> 00:32:26,120
<font color="#ffffff">you're reinstated, Captain Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

278
00:32:31,640 --> 00:32:32,760
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

279
00:32:43,480 --> 00:32:49,000
<font color="#ffffff">CHATCHAWAN</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">PRIVATE DETECTIVE AGENCY<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

280
00:32:53,680 --> 00:32:56,040
<font color="#ffffff">Thanks a lot for telling me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

281
00:33:01,360 --> 00:33:02,720
<font color="#ffffff">What is it, Pop?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

282
00:33:06,000 --> 00:33:08,160
<font color="#ffffff">My contact in the police told me</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

283
00:33:08,240 --> 00:33:09,920
<font color="#ffffff">that Captain Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

284
00:33:10,560 --> 00:33:12,240
<font color="#ffffff">has been reinstated.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

285
00:33:13,040 --> 00:33:14,160
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

286
00:33:15,000 --> 00:33:16,160
<font color="#ffffff">Really, Dad?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

287
00:33:16,240 --> 00:33:17,160
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

288
00:33:17,240 --> 00:33:19,160
<font color="#ffffff">On Deputy Papon's orders.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

289
00:33:20,320 --> 00:33:21,680
<font color="#ffffff">Deputy Papon?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

290
00:33:24,120 --> 00:33:25,480
<font color="#ffffff">What is going on?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

291
00:33:43,080 --> 00:33:43,960
<font color="#ffffff">What did you say?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

292
00:33:44,600 --> 00:33:46,080
<font color="#ffffff">No one is here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

293
00:33:46,160 --> 00:33:47,240
<font color="#ffffff">That's right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

294
00:33:47,320 --> 00:33:50,240
<font color="#ffffff">They said their goodbyes and left.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

295
00:33:55,720 --> 00:33:56,600
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

296
00:34:02,200 --> 00:34:03,280
<font color="#ffffff">What should we do now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

297
00:34:36,600 --> 00:34:40,320
<font color="#ffffff">PRESENTED TO CHANSUEK</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">FOR EXEMPLARY PUBLIC SERVICE<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

298
00:35:46,640 --> 00:35:47,960
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, wait.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

299
00:35:48,040 --> 00:35:49,080
<font color="#ffffff">What are you doing?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

300
00:35:49,160 --> 00:35:51,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'm going inside.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

301
00:35:51,080 --> 00:35:52,960
<font color="#ffffff">You can't!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

302
00:35:53,040 --> 00:35:56,560
<font color="#ffffff">Entering someone's home</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">without permission is trespassing.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

303
00:35:56,640 --> 00:35:59,520
<font color="#ffffff">You're being a full-on cop now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

304
00:35:59,600 --> 00:36:00,480
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

305
00:36:00,560 --> 00:36:02,080
<font color="#ffffff">That's the law.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

306
00:36:02,160 --> 00:36:05,320
<font color="#ffffff">You could even be charged</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">with property damage and theft.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

307
00:36:06,040 --> 00:36:07,120
<font color="#ffffff">And…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

308
00:36:07,840 --> 00:36:09,320
<font color="#ffffff">Whose place is this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

309
00:36:09,400 --> 00:36:11,400
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Chansuek's.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

310
00:36:11,480 --> 00:36:12,720
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

311
00:36:13,640 --> 00:36:14,640
<font color="#ffffff">Is this my house?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

312
00:36:14,720 --> 00:36:17,560
<font color="#ffffff">You seem to be a good man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

313
00:36:17,640 --> 00:36:19,320
<font color="#ffffff">You've won a lot of awards.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

314
00:36:21,840 --> 00:36:25,120
<font color="#ffffff">These things don't tell you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

315
00:36:25,200 --> 00:36:27,760
<font color="#ffffff">whether someone is good or not.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

316
00:36:28,760 --> 00:36:31,240
<font color="#ffffff">At least I see your hard work.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

317
00:36:39,080 --> 00:36:39,920
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

318
00:36:40,000 --> 00:36:42,320
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, nothing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

319
00:36:42,400 --> 00:36:44,640
<font color="#ffffff">What are you looking for?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

320
00:36:45,240 --> 00:36:46,880
<font color="#ffffff">Nothing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

321
00:36:46,960 --> 00:36:49,120
<font color="#ffffff">I think we should go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

322
00:36:50,360 --> 00:36:51,920
<font color="#ffffff">Wait! Hold on!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

323
00:37:22,760 --> 00:37:24,720
<font color="#ffffff">-Freeze!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What is this?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

324
00:37:24,800 --> 00:37:26,440
<font color="#ffffff">Put your gun down.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

325
00:37:30,800 --> 00:37:32,760
<font color="#ffffff">Where did you get that money?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

326
00:37:33,360 --> 00:37:34,840
<font color="#ffffff">I already told you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

327
00:37:35,720 --> 00:37:37,520
<font color="#ffffff">I know nothing about it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

328
00:37:37,600 --> 00:37:39,680
<font color="#ffffff">I was framed.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

329
00:37:40,320 --> 00:37:41,840
<font color="#ffffff">If you cooperate,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

330
00:37:43,160 --> 00:37:44,720
<font color="#ffffff">I'll go easier on you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

331
00:37:51,080 --> 00:37:52,280
<font color="#ffffff">What did he say, Captain?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

332
00:37:52,960 --> 00:37:54,360
<font color="#ffffff">He denies all charges.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

333
00:37:55,920 --> 00:37:57,360
<font color="#ffffff">If he wants to be a thief,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

334
00:37:58,440 --> 00:38:00,680
<font color="#ffffff">then let him rot in prison.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

335
00:38:07,560 --> 00:38:09,920
<font color="#ffffff">Does this mean</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

336
00:38:10,000 --> 00:38:12,920
<font color="#ffffff">you've regained your memory, Boonrod?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

337
00:38:16,920 --> 00:38:18,360
<font color="#ffffff">Or rather,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

338
00:38:19,040 --> 00:38:21,080
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

339
00:38:23,560 --> 00:38:25,520
<font color="#ffffff">I said, do you have the diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

340
00:38:27,600 --> 00:38:28,680
<font color="#ffffff">I do.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

341
00:38:29,400 --> 00:38:31,000
<font color="#ffffff">I have the diamond.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

342
00:38:32,680 --> 00:38:34,440
<font color="#ffffff">Then just finish the mission.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

343
00:38:34,520 --> 00:38:36,000
<font color="#ffffff">Prove your innocence…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

344
00:38:36,080 --> 00:38:38,880
<font color="#ffffff">By bringing that diamond back to me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

345
00:38:41,960 --> 00:38:45,040
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Things just got harder, Boonrod.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

346
00:39:01,880 --> 00:39:05,920
<font color="#ffffff">INCOMING CALL</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">NOONA<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

347
00:39:45,320 --> 00:39:47,080
<font color="#ffffff">He's not answering.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

348
00:40:00,920 --> 00:40:03,160
<font color="#ffffff">My contact in the police told me</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

349
00:40:03,240 --> 00:40:05,440
<font color="#ffffff">that Captain Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

350
00:40:05,520 --> 00:40:07,240
<font color="#ffffff">has been reinstated.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

351
00:40:07,960 --> 00:40:09,000
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

352
00:40:10,000 --> 00:40:11,160
<font color="#ffffff">Really, Dad?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

353
00:40:12,360 --> 00:40:13,920
<font color="#ffffff">On Deputy Papon's orders.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

354
00:40:15,320 --> 00:40:16,280
<font color="#ffffff">Deputy Papon?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

355
00:40:17,240 --> 00:40:18,480
<font color="#ffffff">No one is here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

356
00:40:18,560 --> 00:40:19,640
<font color="#ffffff">That's right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

357
00:40:19,720 --> 00:40:22,640
<font color="#ffffff">They said their goodbyes and left.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

358
00:40:25,160 --> 00:40:26,920
<font color="#ffffff"><i>What's wrong?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

359
00:40:28,240 --> 00:40:29,880
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Are you mad at me?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

360
00:40:29,960 --> 00:40:33,280
<font color="#ffffff">Just get to the point, or I'm hanging up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

361
00:40:34,240 --> 00:40:36,400
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Well, today…</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

362
00:40:37,000 --> 00:40:40,120
<font color="#ffffff"><i>-I want to--</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>-Hey. You're already awake, Chan?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

363
00:40:40,200 --> 00:40:42,240
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Oh, Da.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

364
00:40:42,840 --> 00:40:44,520
<font color="#ffffff">That's it, then. I'm busy.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

365
00:40:51,000 --> 00:40:53,560
<font color="#ffffff">What were you going to tell me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

366
00:41:53,360 --> 00:41:54,720
<font color="#ffffff">Good morning, Captain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

367
00:42:00,160 --> 00:42:01,280
<font color="#ffffff">Captain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

368
00:42:02,640 --> 00:42:03,840
<font color="#ffffff">This way, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

369
00:42:26,520 --> 00:42:27,760
<font color="#ffffff">Sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

370
00:42:36,760 --> 00:42:37,640
<font color="#ffffff">What is it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

371
00:42:38,960 --> 00:42:41,680
<font color="#ffffff">I found out who helped</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea escape.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

372
00:42:41,760 --> 00:42:44,200
<font color="#ffffff">Who? Who is it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

373
00:42:45,640 --> 00:42:46,880
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Kan, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

374
00:42:49,800 --> 00:42:51,960
<font color="#ffffff">Are you sure it's Captain Kan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

375
00:42:54,240 --> 00:42:55,600
<font color="#ffffff">I am, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

376
00:43:00,440 --> 00:43:03,640
<font color="#ffffff">How did you know it was Captain Kan, sir?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

377
00:43:05,960 --> 00:43:08,760
<font color="#ffffff">A witness remembers</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the plate number of the car he took.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

378
00:43:09,320 --> 00:43:11,400
<font color="#ffffff">So I ran the plate number.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

379
00:43:11,480 --> 00:43:13,360
<font color="#ffffff">It's Captain Kan's personal vehicle.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

380
00:43:30,200 --> 00:43:32,240
<font color="#ffffff">It is Captain Kan's car, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

381
00:43:33,160 --> 00:43:35,120
<font color="#ffffff">So where is Captain Kan now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

382
00:43:35,200 --> 00:43:37,240
<font color="#ffffff">He's on vacation, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

383
00:43:44,880 --> 00:43:46,360
<font color="#ffffff">You two.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

384
00:43:46,440 --> 00:43:50,640
<font color="#ffffff">Go find out whether Luang Pho Suea</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">is with Captain Kan.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

385
00:43:50,720 --> 00:43:53,360
<font color="#ffffff">If they're together, arrest them both.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

386
00:43:55,200 --> 00:43:56,840
<font color="#ffffff">-Roger that.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes, sir.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

387
00:44:55,800 --> 00:45:01,520
<font color="#ffffff">What matters most is that</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">you don't hurt the monk if they resist.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

388
00:45:01,600 --> 00:45:03,840
<font color="#ffffff">Try to catch him as soon as you can.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

389
00:45:04,360 --> 00:45:06,840
<font color="#ffffff">We need information from him, understood?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

390
00:45:07,640 --> 00:45:09,200
<font color="#ffffff">-Roger that.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's go.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

391
00:46:05,240 --> 00:46:06,840
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Chansuek? Lieutenant Ae?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

392
00:46:09,760 --> 00:46:10,840
<font color="#ffffff">What's going on?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

393
00:46:12,160 --> 00:46:15,040
<font color="#ffffff">We've received information</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">that you took Luang Pho Suea.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

394
00:46:15,960 --> 00:46:18,320
<font color="#ffffff">We would like to bring him in</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for questioning<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

395
00:46:18,400 --> 00:46:20,680
<font color="#ffffff">regarding Ms. Yok's diamond theft case.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

396
00:46:23,480 --> 00:46:25,400
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea is not here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

397
00:46:25,480 --> 00:46:27,160
<font color="#ffffff">Please leave.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

398
00:46:28,280 --> 00:46:29,440
<font color="#ffffff">Lieutenant Ae.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

399
00:46:30,640 --> 00:46:31,680
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

400
00:46:34,560 --> 00:46:37,560
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, this is an insult to me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

401
00:46:37,640 --> 00:46:39,520
<font color="#ffffff">You don't have a warrant, do you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

402
00:46:40,520 --> 00:46:41,760
<font color="#ffffff">How could you do this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

403
00:46:42,720 --> 00:46:44,360
<font color="#ffffff">It's Deputy Papon's orders.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

404
00:46:53,040 --> 00:46:54,040
<font color="#ffffff">I told you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

405
00:46:54,840 --> 00:46:56,720
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know where Luang Pho Suea is.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

406
00:46:57,440 --> 00:47:00,160
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't take him anywhere, okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

407
00:47:01,000 --> 00:47:04,400
<font color="#ffffff">I would like to replace Captain Kan</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in Ms. Yok's diamond case.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

408
00:47:04,480 --> 00:47:06,960
<font color="#ffffff">NEXT EPISODE</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

409
00:47:07,560 --> 00:47:10,440
<font color="#ffffff">They think the most dangerous place</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">is actually the safest.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

410
00:47:10,520 --> 00:47:11,520
<font color="#ffffff">So what will you do?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

411
00:47:11,600 --> 00:47:15,160
<font color="#ffffff">I would like to take a unit</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and arrest Luang Pho Suea tonight.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

412
00:47:15,760 --> 00:47:19,120
<font color="#ffffff">Is Captain Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">on Deputy Papon's side now?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

413
00:47:19,800 --> 00:47:21,480
<font color="#ffffff">Yes. Pretty much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

414
00:47:32,640 --> 00:47:34,080
<font color="#ffffff">You ungrateful bastard!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

415
00:47:36,840 --> 00:47:39,040
<font color="#ffffff">This girl looks familiar.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

416
00:47:39,120 --> 00:47:40,600
<font color="#ffffff">I think I've seen her before.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

417
00:47:40,680 --> 00:47:42,840
<font color="#ffffff">I've looked into her record.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

418
00:47:42,920 --> 00:47:45,160
<font color="#ffffff">She used to be a cop.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

419
00:50:55,440 --> 00:50:58,440
<font color="#ffffff">Subtitle translation by: Aoy M.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>
